# Delete WP, from the map's right-click menu: deleteWPToolStripMenuItem_Click
# (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:3118). Enabled only over a waypoint, as contextMenuStrip1_Opening has
# it (FlightPlanner.cs:2669), and it removes the waypoint under the cursor.
#
# The first click's waypoint moves when the map frames it; the second one's does not, because the
# second press freezes the view. So the right-click aims at the second.

screen plan
window 1600x1200
settle 4

click map@0.45x0.40
click map@0.60x0.55
expect mission.items 2

# Off the waypoints Delete WP is disabled, and clicking it does nothing.
click map@0.30x0.70:right
expect plan.menu open
expect plan.menu.delete false
click menu-deleteWP
expect mission.items 2
click map@0.20x0.20
expect plan.menu closed
expect mission.items 2

# On the second waypoint it is enabled, and removes it.
click map@0.60x0.55:right
expect plan.menu.delete true
click menu-deleteWP
expect plan.menu closed
expect mission.items 1
expect mission.commands 16
